ities, and edit his stats to make yourself unbeatable against the hordes of creatures you'll be up against. Solve puzzles and complete missions left and right while you reconquer this extensive land in front of you. Find abilities you'd never discovered before, gain an upper hand against your enemies, and meet new friends along the way! This world is your's for the taking in this amazing RPG experience you'll be left asking for more!",
